  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jakarta ICMPS 2022 YAYASAN PENA BULU JAKARTA VDI125</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Improving Acceleration and Capacity for CSOs Towards More Access to HIV Testing and Treatment in Jakarta, Indonesia, implemented by Penabulu Foundation aims to contribute to strengthen the institutional capacity of civil society organizations (CSOs) implementing partners for the HIV program in 26 priority districts/cities in Indonesia.  The objectives of the grant is to support the &#x2018;Impact+ project&#x2019; from Penabulu Foundation. ICMPCS funds will provide intensive face-to-face technical assistance for 6 CSOs from 6 districts. The key activities include Face-to-Face training with experts focusing on: 1) improving strategic planning; 2) developing an online portfolio of CSOs work to improve eligibility to access the social contracting funding schemes from the Indonesian government.</narrative>
  </description>
